-    # ``p.parent.parent``), hard-coded to the depth of
-    # ``PLAN-*/architect/round-*/approved.md``. The ``PLAN-*`` segment one
-    # level further up was never checked, so
-    # ``.claude/plans/PLAN-EVIL -> /tmp/evil`` smuggled a foreign
