   200	
   201	    Runtime code MUST NOT call this as a fallback: resolving state
   202	    here re-opens the cross-tenant mixing the W1 closes. The name is
   203	    deliberately loud so ``derive-audit-family.py --assert-migrated``
   204	    style sweeps can allowlist the few sanctioned callers.
