     6	## Contract (ADR-001 S318 amendment, ratified 2026-08-20)
     7	
     8	1. ``<project-slug>`` is the **native Claude Code path-based slug** of
     9	   the project's absolute path: ``str(path)`` with every ``/`` replaced
    10	   by ``-`` (e.g. ``/Users/<user>/repo`` → ``-Users-<user>-repo``). This is the
    11	   SAME derivation the current harness uses for
    12	   ``~/.claude/projects/<slug>/`` (memory, transcripts), so framework
    13	   runtime state co-locates with harness state for the same project.
    14	2. **One resolver, imported by the whole family.** No file in the
    15	   audit/state family may re-derive the directory locally. Every module
    16	   that previously built the literal
    17	   ``$HOME/.claude/projects/ceo-orchestration`` delegates here.
    18	3. **Family-atomicity:** ``runtime_state_dir()`` is the ONE base dir;
    19	   log, key, lock, errors, ``.salt``, rotation siblings and sidecars
    20	   are all resolved as children of it (per-family wrappers may keep
    21	   their own more-specific env overrides, but their DEFAULT is this
    22	   base — never a locally re-derived path).
    23	
    24	## Precedence (highest first)
    25	
    26	1. ``CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR_NATIVE`` — documented whole-directory override
    27	   (ADR-001 Decision; this module is its FIRST consumer — the original
    28	   spec fiction of an override with zero consumers is repaired here).
