   109	) -> dict:
   110	    """Check exact scope and optional *fresh* SHA-256 pins; never approve.
   111	
   112	    ``expected_sha256`` pins must cover every modified canonical path, or
   113	    are omitted altogether. Content pins are remeasured from disk on each
